P2
  Change: AttentionHandle (Client::attention_handle, re-exported at the crate
          root) lets another thread ask the connection to send Attention for
          the request in flight; the connection sends it at its next packet
          poll, a read already pending included, and a request is forgotten
          by the next send. Once an Attention is sent, every token stream and
          flush_stream read past end-of-message until the message whose final
          DONE carries DONE_ATTN; simple_query_items yields that Done with
          attention: true as its last item. cancel_query reads its
          acknowledgement across messages: the diff of PR #460 at head
          f177f879dfb83d8a8d8276f02ae61859691b7d11, applied unchanged.
          Client::drain_attention stops the request in flight and discards
          the rest of its response packet by packet through flush_stream's
          loop, so rows buffered in the socket are not decoded.
          Client::forget_transaction clears the transaction descriptor, for a
          caller whose drain lost the ENVCHANGE that ended the transaction;
          Client::transaction_descriptor reads it. drain_attention returns
          whether the response was still being stopped, not whole.
  Files: src/tds/stream/token.rs, src/client/connection.rs, src/client.rs,
         src/lib.rs, tests/query.rs
  Upstream: tiberius-rs/tiberius#459,
            https://github.com/tiberius-rs/tiberius/pull/460 (the cancel fix);
            the handle: none found

P3
  Change: Client::simple_query_items sends one SQL Batch and returns a
          QueryStream in items mode, which yields QueryItem::Done (a DoneItem
          with kind, row count, MORE, ERROR and ATTN bits and CurCmd) for every
          DONE, DONEINPROC and DONEPROC token and QueryItem::Error for every
          ERROR token, in wire order, and ends without repeating the held-back
          server error. Every other query path behaves as before.
  Files: src/tds/stream/query.rs, src/client.rs, src/result.rs,
         src/tds/codec/token/token_done.rs, tests/query.rs
  Upstream: none found (searched tiberius-rs/tiberius issues and PRs, 2026-10-29)

